<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>HTML Learning Project</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            --primary-color: #0056b3; /* Biru */
            --accent-color: #ffc107;  /* Kuning */
            --success-color: #28a745; /* Hijau */
            --text-color: #24292e;
            --bg-color: #f0f7f4;      /* Nuansa latar belakang hijau muda lembut */
            --card-bg: #ffffff;
            --border-color: #d4edda;   /* Border hijau muda */
        }

        body {
            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
            background-color: var(--bg-color);
            color: var(--text-color);
            line-height: 1.6;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 20px;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 800px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            background: var(--card-bg);
            padding: 40px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(40, 167, 69, 0.08);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
        }

        h1, h2, h3, h4 {
            color: #1b1f23;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            padding-bottom: 8px;
            margin-top: 24px;
        }

        h1 {
            text-align: center;
            border-bottom: 2px solid var(--accent-color);
            color: var(--primary-color);
        }

        blockquote {
            background: #fff3cd; /* Kuning lembut */
            border-left: 4px solid var(--accent-color);
            margin: 20px 0;
            padding: 15px 20px;
            border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0;
            color: #856404;
        }

        blockquote ul {
            margin: 0;
            padding-left: 20px;
        }

        code {
            background-color: #e8f5e9; /* Hijau sangat muda */
            color: var(--success-color);
            padding: 2px 6px;
            border-radius: 4px;
            font-family: "SFMono-Regular", Consolas, "Liberation Mono", Menlo, monospace;
            font-size: 85%;
        }

        pre {
            background-color: #1e3d2f; /* Nuansa gelap senada */
            color: #e8f5e9;
            padding: 16px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            overflow-x: auto;
        }

        pre code {
            background-color: transparent;
            color: inherit;
            padding: 0;
            font-size: 90%;
        }

        table {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: collapse;
            margin: 20px 0;
        }

        th, td {
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            padding: 12px;
            text-align: left;
        }

        th {
            background-color: #e8f5e9; /* Hijau muda */
            color: #155724;
        }

        form {
            background: #fdfefe;
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            margin-top: 20px;
        }

        label {
            display: block;
            margin-top: 12px;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: var(--primary-color);
        }

        input[type="text"], input[type="email"], select, textarea {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 10px;
            margin-top: 6px;
            border: 1px solid #c3e6cb;
            border-radius: 6px;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        textarea {
            height: 100px;
            resize: vertical;
        }

        button {
            background-color: var(--success-color); /* Hijau */
            color: white;
            border: none;
            padding: 12px 20px;
            font-size: 14px;
            font-weight: 600;
            border-radius: 6px;
            cursor: pointer;
            margin-top: 16px;
            width: 100%;
        }

        button:hover {
            background-color: #218838;
        }

        .footer-banner {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary-color), var(--success-color)); /* Gradasi Biru ke Hijau dengan aksen Kuning */
            color: white;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            margin-top: 40px;
            border-bottom: 4px solid var(--accent-color);
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="container">
    <h1>🌐 HTML Learning Project</h1>
    <p style="text-align: center; font-style: italic;">Master the Building Blocks of the Web</p>

    <!-- 1. What is HTML -->
    <h2>🚀 What is HTML?</h2>
    <p><strong>HTML (HyperText Markup Language)</strong> is the standard markup language for creating web pages. Think of it as the skeleton or foundation of every website you visit.</p>
    
    <blockquote>
        <strong>Key Points:</strong>
        <ul>
            <li><strong>HyperText:</strong> Text with links to other texts</li>
            <li><strong>Markup:</strong> A way to annotate text to show structure and meaning</li>
            <li><strong>Language:</strong> A set of rules and syntax for creating web content</li>
        </ul>
    </blockquote>

    <h3>🏗️ How HTML Works</h3>
    <p>HTML uses <strong>tags</strong> to define elements. Tags are keywords surrounded by angle brackets like <code>&lt;tagname&gt;</code>. Most tags come in pairs:</p>
<pre><code>&lt;tagname&gt;Content goes here&lt;/tagname&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;This is a heading&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a paragraph&lt;/p&gt;</code></pre>

    <!-- 2. Basic HTML Structure -->
    <h2>📋 Basic HTML Structure</h2>
    <p>Every HTML document follows this basic structure:</p>
<pre><code>&lt;!DOCTYPE html&gt;
&lt;html lang="en"&gt;
&lt;head&gt;
    &lt;meta charset="UTF-8"&gt;
    &lt;meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"&gt;
    &lt;title&gt;Page Title&lt;/title&gt;
&lt;/head&gt;
&lt;body&gt;
    &lt;h1&gt;Welcome to My Website&lt;/h1&gt;
    &lt;p&gt;This is my first paragraph.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/body&gt;
&lt;/html&gt;</code></pre>

    <blockquote>
        <strong>Structure Breakdown:</strong>
        <ul>
            <li><code>&lt;!DOCTYPE html&gt;</code> Tells the browser this is HTML5</li>
            <li><code>&lt;html&gt;</code> Root element of the page</li>
            <li><code>&lt;head&gt;</code> Contains metadata (not visible on page)</li>
            <li><code>&lt;body&gt;</code> Contains visible content</li>
        </ul>
    </blockquote>

    <!-- 3. Essential HTML Tags -->
    <h2>🏷️ Essential HTML Tags</h2>
    <table>
        <thead>
            <tr>
                <th>Tag</th>
                <th>Purpose</th>
                <th>Example</th>
            </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
            <tr>
                <td><code>&lt;h1&gt; - &lt;h6&gt;</code></td>
                <td>Headings (largest to smallest)</td>
                <td><code>&lt;h1&gt;Main Title&lt;/h1&gt;</code></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td><code>&lt;p&gt;</code></td>
                <td>Paragraphs</td>
                <td><code>&lt;p&gt;This is text&lt;/p&gt;</code></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td><code>&lt;a&gt;</code></td>
                <td>Links</td>
                <td><code>&lt;a href="url"&gt;Link text&lt;/a&gt;</code></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td><code>&lt;img&gt;</code></td>
                <td>Images</td>
                <td><code>&lt;img src="image.jpg" alt="Description"&gt;</code></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td><code>&lt;div&gt;</code></td>
                <td>Container/section</td>
                <td><code>&lt;div&gt;Content here&lt;/div&gt;</code></td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td><code>&lt;ul&gt;, &lt;ol&gt;, &lt;li&gt;</code></td>
                <td>Lists</td>
                <td><code>&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Item&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;</code></td>
            </tr>
        </tbody>
    </table>

    <h3>🎯 Live Examples:</h3>
    <h1>This is an H1 heading</h1>
    <h2>This is an H2 heading</h2>
    <h3>This is an H3 heading</h3>
    <p>This is a paragraph with <strong>bold text</strong> and <em>italic text</em>.</p>
    <p>Here's a <a href="#" style="color: var(--primary-color);">sample link</a>.</p>

    <h4>Unordered List:</h4>
    <ul>
        <li>First item</li>
        <li>Second item</li>
        <li>Third item</li>
    </ul>

    <h4>Ordered List:</h4>
    <ol>
        <li>Step one</li>
        <li>Step two</li>
        <li>Step three</li>
    </ol>

    <!-- 4. HTML Forms -->
    <h2>📝 HTML Forms</h2>
    <p>Forms allow users to input data.</p>

    <form action="#" method="POST">
        <label for="name">Name:</label>
        <input type="text" id="name" name="name" placeholder="Masukkan nama Anda">
        
        <label for="email">Email:</label>
        <input type="email" id="email" name="email" placeholder="contoh@email.com">
        
        <label for="subject">Subject:</label>
        <select id="subject" name="subject">
            <option value="question">Question</option>
            <option value="feedback">Feedback</option>
            <option value="support">Support</option>
        </select>
        
        <label for="message">Message:</label>
        <textarea id="message" name="message" placeholder="Tulis pesan Anda di sini..."></textarea>
        
        <button type="submit">Submit Form Button</button>
    </form>

    <!-- 5. HTML Attributes -->
    <h2>🎨 HTML Attributes</h2>
    <p>Attributes provide additional information about HTML elements:</p>
<pre><code>&lt;!-- Common attributes --&gt;
&lt;img src="photo.jpg" alt="A beautiful sunset" width="300" height="200"&gt;
&lt;a href="https://example.com" target="_blank" title="Visit Example"&gt;Click here&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;div class="container" id="main-content" style="color: blue;"&gt;Content&lt;/div&gt;</code></pre>

    <blockquote>
        <strong>Important Attributes:</strong>
        <ul>
            <li><strong>id:</strong> Unique identifier for an element</li>
            <li><strong>class:</strong> Groups elements for styling</li>
            <li><strong>src:</strong> Source file for images, videos, etc.</li>
            <li><strong>href:</strong> URL for links</li>
        </ul>
    </blockquote>

    <div class="footer-banner">
        <h3>Keep Learning & Coding! 🚀</h3>
        <p>Built with HTML & CSS</p>
    </div>
</div>

</body>
</html>